<title>USA: Moody's ups Den Danske Bank debt rating.</title>
<headline>Moody's ups Den Danske Bank debt rating.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, June 3 - Moody's Investors Service assigned an A1 rating to Den Danske Bank's forthcoming subordinated debt issue. Concomitantly, Moody's raised to A1 from A2 the rating of the bank's outstanding subordinated debt.</p>
<p>These rating actions are based on the fact that Den Danske Bank's stabilized financial strength substantially reduces the risks associated with such instruments.</p>
</text>
